$('panel-inventory').innerHTML='<h2>冷凍庫存管理</h2><p id="inventoryNotice" role="status"></p><nav class="inventory-actions"><button data-inv-go="home">庫存首頁</button><button data-inv-go="receipt">製作／入庫</button><button data-inv-go="stats">製作統計</button><button data-inv-go="adjust">盤點／報廢</button><button data-inv-go="history">歷史紀錄</button></nav><p id="inventoryBaseline"></p><p id="inventoryDemandWarning" class="management-error hidden" role="alert"></p><section data-inv-view="home"><div id="inventoryList" class="inventory-cards"></div><form id="inventoryInit" class="card"><h3>首次盤點與啟用</h3><p>尚未啟用時暫停出貨。請先關閉其他裝置舊分頁，暫停出貨並輸入冷凍庫目前實際包數；期初不列入製作統計、不補扣歷史已出貨單。</p><div id="inventoryCounts"></div><button class="primary">預覽並確認啟用</button></form></section><section data-inv-view="receipt" class="hidden"><h3 id="receiptTitle">新增製作／入庫</h3><form id="inventoryReceipt"><label>類型<select id="receiptType"><option value="production">料理包製作（列製作統計）</option><option value="inbound">其他入庫（不列製作統計）</option></select></label><label>製作／入庫日期<input id="receiptDate" type="date" required></label><p class="management-help">不得補登已含期初現貨的製作。日期不明的期初現貨不推測製作日期。</p><div id="receiptLines"></div><button type="button" id="receiptAdd">新增商品</button><label>備註<textarea id="receiptNotes"></textarea></label><div class="inventory-form-actions"><button class="primary">儲存入庫</button><button type="button" data-inv-go="home">取消／返回</button></div></form></section><section data-inv-view="stats" class="hidden"><h3>製作數量統計</h3><div class="row"><button data-stat-period="day">今日</button><button data-stat-period="month">本月</button></div><label>月份<input type="month" id="productionMonth"></label><div class="row"><label>開始日期<input type="date" id="productionStart"></label><label>結束日期<input type="date" id="productionEnd"></label></div><p>依製作日期加總有效製作紀錄；期初、其他入庫、退貨、盤點及報廢不列入。報廢不減少曾實際製作數量。</p><div id="productionTotals"></div><div id="productionDaily"></div><button id="productionCsv">匯出製作 CSV</button></section><section data-inv-view="adjust" class="hidden"><h3>盤點／報廢／其他調整</h3><form id="stockForm"><label>商品<select id="stockProduct"></select></label><label>方式<select id="stockMode"><option value="delta">數量增減（報廢填負數）</option><option value="count">盤點實際包數（新商品先用此方式）</option></select></label><label>包數<input id="stockQty" required type="number" step="1"></label><label>原因<input id="stockReason" required placeholder="破包、報廢、試吃、盤點…"></label><p>盤點以開啟表單時庫存為準；其他裝置更新後需重新開啟確認。</p><div class="inventory-form-actions"><button class="primary">確認調整</button><button type="button" data-inv-go="home">返回</button></div></form></section><section data-inv-view="history" class="hidden"><h3>製作與入庫紀錄</h3><label>搜尋商品／原因／備註<input id="inventorySearch" type="search"></label><div class="row"><label>開始日期<input type="date" id="inventoryHistoryStart"></label><label>結束日期<input type="date" id="inventoryHistoryEnd"></label></div><label>商品<select id="inventoryHistoryProduct"><option value="">全部商品</option></select></label><div id="receiptHistory"></div><h3>所有庫存異動</h3><div id="movementList"></div><h3>操作追溯</h3><div id="inventoryAudit"></div></section>';
